<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Power raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Power raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it upgraded American Power Conversion Corp to buy from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/8 to 17-5/8.</p>
